/v/t64.5771-25/39031545_1695566271189918_7563581897204183653_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E7jLj35VXoEQ7kNvwF6rKCB&_nc_oc=AdmlRyxovgjW5UoscAMWO5htDq7t3OcIkXsmJpPMCMatMEh7-Gz-T_ZH_W3Njmp_TFs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv5RaNtKNjm8Dsg_Qs0rztb-xxU20HN_dbCu9VQlqLvSg&oe=699D893C"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "3751167238508534", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001725_3751167241841867_2951941851866511973_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hLUa_JLWBDEQ7kNvwGoos7Q&_nc_oc=AdlxPV3pxOg1W6EzzPv_8fuPzzxlzpJJouJr0bCLlwqofruZiWA_wN2L8NsuI7KAT20&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvMu4RXoA2zDr6e-EINBNLEOhs7tbBbLdJQVttnP_NRCg&oe=699D91DD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1691892224915749", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75580056_1691892228249082_8993988736869608245_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OqRUHvxjvaAQ7kNvwFCjAS_&_nc_oc=AdkaIXRr6qN-tT-xkjXOYSIomL0vm3n9uao1eRe0U4ft3jlSuFUxw3LPXfOBnoWiuUI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu_hO7FktBA70AtEsZuGebBxHSg6HzIKRy8UguFx88a9Q&oe=699D935A"}, "display_name": "Stealthy Swipers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Description:\nImmerse yourself in the thrilling world of \"Stealthy Swipers,\" a cutting-edge VR game where your mission is to \"borrow\" valuable items from a vast, high-tech environment while evading detection by the colossal room owner. This game combines intense stealth mechanics, strategic gameplay, and a rich, futuristic setting to deliver an unforgettable virtual reality experience.\n\nGame Features:\n\n    Immersive VR Environment:\n        Experience a meticulously crafted, enormous space brought to life with state-of-the-art VR graphics. The game environment is designed to be visually stunning and deeply immersive, making you feel like you are truly inside a high-tech, futuristic world.\n\n    